  dialogueLines:
  - I know your path. You seek to bargain with Death
  - for your brother's soul
  - Foolish. Death does not negotiate. You will fail
  - Listen carefully. The only way is war
  - Hunt the other Horsemen. Seize their artifacts.
  - Only with their power  you can destroy Death.
